    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/701ff58854612664bcf79949b05ff413.poster.avif?t=1724739898\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/701ff58854612664bcf79949b05ff413.webm?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/701ff58854612664bcf79949b05ff413.mp4?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You have come from outer space to the devastated Earth. You are a man of the past, trapped in a rough and bleak future of the IRON WORLD. Can you survive?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A personal ride</strong></h2>Drive your own car. Carry your stuff in the trunk. Shoot away with your turret or crush your enemies under the wheels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Random events</strong></h2>Random loot, random enemies, random events, random level generation. Each game will be different from the last.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the world</strong></h2>Before you is a ruined world. You are free to go wherever you want. Towns, farms, mountains and the wasteland itself await you. Realistic layout of buildings and their interior allows for a more immersive CQB action. What's waiting around the corner? Create your own adventure.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/1fdaa9e66b70517bfbe57b51d3ce92d2.poster.avif?t=1724739898\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/1fdaa9e66b70517bfbe57b51d3ce92d2.webm?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/1fdaa9e66b70517bfbe57b51d3ce92d2.mp4?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncompromising fights</strong></h2>Dynamic and bloody battles. Move quickly, use cover, ambush your foes. Use grenades and boosters to survive and overwhelm even the deadliest of enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical AI</strong></h2>The enemies will react to your actions. They will detect you by noise, and will look for you after you've hidden from sight. Rest assured - they will find you, and they will surprise you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visual style</strong></h2>Carefully constructed atmosphere of devastation and ruin. Very detailed locations. Original artstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft</strong></h2>Scavenge resources from every available source. Craft food, ammo and drugs. Good nutrition is key to survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Charismatic NPCs</strong></h2>Meet colorful NPCs as you explore. We put work into creating interesting, sarcastic, cynical characters.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/701ff58854612664bcf79949b05ff413.poster.avif?t=1724739898\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/701ff58854612664bcf79949b05ff413.webm?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/701ff58854612664bcf79949b05ff413.mp4?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You have come from outer space to the devastated Earth. You are a man of the past, trapped in a rough and bleak future of the IRON WORLD. Can you survive?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A personal ride</strong></h2>Drive your own car. Carry your stuff in the trunk. Shoot away with your turret or crush your enemies under the wheels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Random events</strong></h2>Random loot, random enemies, random events, random level generation. Each game will be different from the last.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the world</strong></h2>Before you is a ruined world. You are free to go wherever you want. Towns, farms, mountains and the wasteland itself await you. Realistic layout of buildings and their interior allows for a more immersive CQB action. What's waiting around the corner? Create your own adventure.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/1fdaa9e66b70517bfbe57b51d3ce92d2.poster.avif?t=1724739898\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/1fdaa9e66b70517bfbe57b51d3ce92d2.webm?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687730/extras/1fdaa9e66b70517bfbe57b51d3ce92d2.mp4?t=1724739898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncompromising fights</strong></h2>Dynamic and bloody battles. Move quickly, use cover, ambush your foes. Use grenades and boosters to survive and overwhelm even the deadliest of enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical AI</strong></h2>The enemies will react to your actions. They will detect you by noise, and will look for you after you've hidden from sight. Rest assured - they will find you, and they will surprise you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visual style</strong></h2>Carefully constructed atmosphere of devastation and ruin. Very detailed locations. Original artstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft</strong></h2>Scavenge resources from every available source. Craft food, ammo and drugs. Good nutrition is key to survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Charismatic NPCs</strong></h2>Meet colorful NPCs as you explore. We put work into creating interesting, sarcastic, cynical characters.",
